  "source_code": "t = int(input())\r\n\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = sorted(map(int,input().strip().split()), reverse = True)\r\n    \r\n    a.sort(reverse = True)\r\n    p = [0] * (3*n+1)\r\n    \r\n    for i in range(3 * n):\r\n        \r\n        p [ i + 1] = p[i] + a[i]\r\n        \r\n    \r\n    ans = 0\r\n    \r\n    b = n\r\n    \r\n    for x in range(n+1):\r\n        b = min(b , n -x)\r\n        \r\n        while b > 0:\r\n            \r\n            i = x + 2 * b - 2\r\n            j = x + 2 * b - 1\r\n            k = 3 * n - 2 * x - b\r\n            \r\n            \r\n            if a[i] + a[j] < 3 * a[k]:\r\n                b -= 1\r\n            else:\r\n                break\r\n            \r\n            \r\n        c = n - x - b\r\n        m = x + 2 * b\r\n        r = m + 3 * c\r\n        \r\n        score = (\r\n            6 * p[x]\r\n            + 4 * (p[m] - p[x])\r\n            + 3 * (p[r] - p[m])\r\n            )\r\n            \r\n        ans = max(ans,score)\r\n        \r\n    print(ans)",
